<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
body{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a2634;margin:0;padding:40px}
.logo{text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #194445;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:24px}
.logo-name{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445;letter-spacing:8px}
.logo-sub{font-size:9px;color:#7a9898;margin-top:4px}
h2{color:#194445;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4eaeb;padding-bottom:6px;margin-top:20px}
.row{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-bottom:8px}
.fld{flex:1} .fl{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#7a9898}
.fv{font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:10px}
thead th{background:#194445;color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
tbody td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8eef0}
tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#f0f6f6}
.kpi-grid{display:flex;gap:16px;margin:16px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.kpi-card{flex:1;min-width:120px;background:#f0f6f6;border:1px solid #d4eaeb;border-radius:4px;padding:14px;text-align:center}
.kpi-label{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#7a9898}
.kpi-value{font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445;margin-top:4px}
.kpi-sub{font-size:9px;color:#7a9898;margin-top:2px}
.status-active{color:#194445;font-weight:bold}
.status-paid{color:#2e7d32}
.status-overdue{color:#c62828}
.status-default{color:#e65100}
.breakdown-box{background:#f0f6f6;border:1px solid #d4eaeb;padding:14px;margin:16px 0;border-radius:4px}
.breakdown-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:11px}
.breakdown-total{font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445;border-top:1px solid #194445;padding-top:6px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.foot{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding-top:8px;font-size:8.5px;color:#9aafaf;text-align:center}
.note{font-size:9px;color:#7a9898;margin-top:16px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="logo">
  <div class="logo-name">V I D A</div>
  <div class="logo-sub">VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R. &middot; RFC: {{sofomRfc}}</div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:9px;color:#7a9898">REPORTE MENSUAL DE CARTERA</div>
</div>

<div class="row" style="margin-bottom:16px">
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Periodo</div><div class="fv">{{periodLabel}}</div></div>
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Fecha de generaci&oacute;n</div><div class="fv">{{generatedDate}}</div></div>
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Folio</div><div class="fv">{{reportId}}</div></div>
</div>

<h2>Indicadores clave</h2>
<div class="kpi-grid">
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Cartera total</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">${{totalPortfolio}}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">MXN</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Pr&eacute;stamos activos</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">{{activeLoans}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Tasa de morosidad</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">{{delinquencyRate}}%</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Empresas activas</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">{{activeEmployers}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Desembolsos del mes</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">${{monthlyDisbursed}}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">MXN</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Cobros del mes</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">${{monthlyCollected}}</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">MXN</div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Desglose por estatus</h2>
<div class="breakdown-box">
  <div class="breakdown-row"><span>Al corriente</span><span>{{currentCount}} pr&eacute;stamos &mdash; ${{currentAmount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="breakdown-row"><span>Vencidos (1-30 d&iacute;as)</span><span>{{overdue30Count}} pr&eacute;stamos &mdash; ${{overdue30Amount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="breakdown-row"><span>Vencidos (31-60 d&iacute;as)</span><span>{{overdue60Count}} pr&eacute;stamos &mdash; ${{overdue60Amount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="breakdown-row"><span>Vencidos (61-90 d&iacute;as)</span><span>{{overdue90Count}} pr&eacute;stamos &mdash; ${{overdue90Amount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="breakdown-row"><span>Cartera vencida (&gt;90 d&iacute;as)</span><span>{{overdueOver90Count}} pr&eacute;stamos &mdash; ${{overdueOver90Amount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="breakdown-total"><span><strong>Total cartera</strong></span><span><strong>${{totalPortfolio}} MXN</strong></span></div>
</div>

<h2>Top empresas por cartera</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th>
      <th>Empresa</th>
      <th>Pr&eacute;stamos activos</th>
      <th>Cartera vigente</th>
      <th>Cartera vencida</th>
      <th>Tasa morosidad</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{#each employers}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{rowNum}}</td>
      <td>{{name}}</td>
      <td>{{activeLoans}}</td>
      <td>${{currentPortfolio}}</td>
      <td>${{overduePortfolio}}</td>
      <td>{{delinquencyRate}}%</td>
    </tr>
    {{/each}}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="note">
  <p>Este reporte es confidencial y de uso exclusivo interno de VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R. La informaci&oacute;n contenida refleja el estado de la cartera al cierre del periodo indicado.</p>
</div>

<div class="foot">VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R. &middot; {{sofomAddress}} &middot; contacto@vidafinance.mx &middot; CONDUSEF 01800 999 8080</div>
</body>
</html>
